SUMMARY:Hebrew day 16: Places / Μέρη
DESCRIPTION:BAH-yeet  =  Σπίτι  /  House / home\nkhah-NOOT  =  Μαγ
 αζί  /  Shop\nSHOOK  =  Λαϊκή αγορά  /  Market\nbayt kah-FEH 
  =  Καφετέρια  /  Café\nmees-ah-DAH  =  Εστιατόριο  / 
  Restaurant\nmah-LOHN  =  Ξενοδοχείο  /  Hotel\nYAHM  =  Θάλ
 ασσα  /  Sea\nEER  =  Πόλη  /  City\n\nSentence: ah-NEE hoh-LEKH l
 ah-SHOOK.\n= Πάω στη λαϊκή.\n\nTip: “la-” = to the. La-yam 
 = to the sea\, la-shuk = to the market.\n\n(CAPS = stressed syllable\, kh 
 = Greek χ)
